<title>DUBAI: Saudi Al-Azizia-Panda 1996 net profit up.</title>
<headline>Saudi Al-Azizia-Panda 1996 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p>Net profit		  61.8	     vs     61.4</p>
<p>Pre-tax		     67.4	     vs     66.7</p>
<p>Sales			 621.8	    vs     495.2</p>
<p>Total assets		139.1	    vs     136.0</p>
<p>	     Full Name: Al-Azizia-Panda United Inc.</p>
<p>	     Note - The supermarket chain is traded on the Saudi</p>
<p>stock market.</p>
</text>
